  "视觉特征为本项目图像观察；地域推定以档案标注为准。语义标签是对角色分类的项目解释，尚未形成独立的语义标注。": "Visual features are observations made for this project. Regional attributions follow the source archive. Semantic labels are project interpretations of role categories, not independently annotated meanings.",
