  "陈咬金地戏面具  地戏由于剧目丰富、人物众多，面具的造型也更为丰富，大体可分为五类，包括主将、道人、丑角、动物和世俗人物；程咬金被认为是福将，所以在地戏面具的刻画上。面形明显修长，纵向感强，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡。": "Chen Yaojin dixi mask. Dixi has many plays and characters, reflected in a wide range of mask forms, broadly grouped as leading generals, Daoists, clowns, animals and secular figures. Cheng Yaojin is regarded as a fortunate general, an association reflected in the treatment of his dixi mask. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced.",
