  "伯安，90版封神榜原创角色，西伯侯姬昌第三子，心术不正，偏又爱出风头，且为人轻佻，先后受叔父姬遂和申公豹的蛊惑，合谋刺杀姬发，阴谋败露，被姬昌贬为庶民，但伯安仍不知悔改，主动投靠商军。面形明显修长，纵向感强，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡。": "Bo'an, an original character in the 1990 television adaptation of Investiture of the Gods, is Ji Chang's third son. Vain and scheming, he is influenced by Ji Sui and Shen Gongbao to plot Ji Fa's assassination. After the plot is exposed he is reduced to commoner status, yet remains unrepentant and joins the Shang army. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced.",
