  "色彩以深灰色和橙黄色为主，局部有黄色和绿色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are dark gray and yellow-orange, with accents of yellow and green; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
