  "色彩以棕褐色和橙黄色为主；整体色调偏暖，明暗过渡较平缓，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are brown and yellow-orange; a warm overall palette, gentle transitions between light and dark, moderate saturation.",
  "整体轮廓偏长，线条较疏朗，五官轮廓清楚，左右结构稳定，下半部口部、下颌或须部线条更突出；口鼻处理较夸张，兽面感明显，外形偏向镇邪类面具。": "The overall outline is elongated, the lines are relatively sparse and the features clearly outlined, the left and right sides are structurally balanced, the mouth, jaw or beard is more prominent in the lower face. The exaggerated mouth and nose suggest an animal face and the appearance of a protective mask.",
  "色彩以棕褐色和深灰色为主；整体色调偏暖，明暗过渡较平缓，色彩偏素净。": "The main colors are brown and dark gray; a warm overall palette, gentle transitions between light and dark, subdued colors.",
