  "贵州安顺地戏面具鱼嘴道人， 角色：反派 出处：鱼嘴道人出现在安顺地戏薛丁山征西中，由鱼精变化而成，阻碍薛丁山西征。面形明显修长，纵向感强，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡。": "Fish-Mouthed Daoist, an Anshun dixi mask from Guizhou. This antagonist in Xue Dingshan's Western Campaign is a transformed fish spirit who obstructs the expedition. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced.",
  "色彩以黄色和橙黄色为主，局部有绿色和红色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩较鲜明。": "The main colors are yellow and yellow-orange, with accents of green and red; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, vivid colors.",
  "面部横向展开，外轮廓较宽，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，五官布局较均衡，下半部口部、下颌或须部线条更突出；眉眼和口鼻通常处理得较有力度，整体面相偏威严。": "The face spreads horizontally, creating a broad outline, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the facial features are evenly balanced, the mouth, jaw or beard is more prominent in the lower face. Forceful brows, eyes, mouth and nose give the face an imposing expression.",
