  "兰陵王，形象狰狞，头上一只神鸟，环形豹眼，一个大美傩面。面形明显修长，纵向感强，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定。": "The Prince of Lanling has a fierce face, a divine bird on his head and ring-shaped leopard eyes; an imposing Nuo mask. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced.",
  "色彩以棕褐色和深灰色为主，局部有黑色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗过渡较平缓，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are brown and dark gray, with accents of black; a warm overall palette, gentle transitions between light and dark, moderate saturation.",
  "在古代两军对垒，那都是刀光剑影、杀气腾腾，细皮嫩肉、跟姑娘似的将领，往往都会被对方藐视，难以鼓舞士气，为了不让敌人小瞧，兰陵王想出个招儿，弄了个狰狞恐怖的面具；每次上战场。面形明显修长，纵向感强，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定。": "In the story, the delicate-looking Prince of Lanling adopts a terrifying mask so that enemies will not underestimate him and his troops will be inspired in battle. Whenever he goes into battle. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced.",
  "色彩以青色和深灰色为主，局部有绿色和灰色点缀；整体色调偏冷，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are cyan and dark gray, with accents of green and gray; a cool overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
  "兰陵王傩面，形象狰狞，头上一只神鸟，环形豹眼。面形明显修长，纵向感强，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定。": "The Prince of Lanling Nuo mask has a fierce face, a divine bird on its head and ring-shaped leopard eyes. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced.",
