  "色彩以灰色和橙黄色为主，局部有棕褐色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are gray and yellow-orange, with accents of brown; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
  "白面美髯，头戴方角幞头，身着黄短绣衫，右手持枪，枪上有白蛇缠绕。整体轮廓偏长，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，左右结构稳定；眉眼和口鼻通常处理得较有力度，整体面相偏威严。": "A pale face and fine beard, with a square-cornered futou hat and a short yellow embroidered robe; the right hand holds a spear entwined by a white snake. The overall outline is elongated, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced. Forceful brows, eyes, mouth and nose give the face an imposing expression.",
