  "恩施木质傩面具角色笑罗汉， 笑罗汉是十八罗汉的第二尊欢喜罗汉的别称。脸形接近方正，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定；眉眼和口部处理较柔和，表情倾向含笑、亲近。": "The Laughing Arhat, depicted in an Enshi wooden Nuo mask, is another name for the Joyful Arhat, second of the Eighteen Arhats. The face is approximately square, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced. Softly treated brows, eyes and mouth create a smiling, approachable expression.",
