  "即在一个大虎头内含有四个小虎头，额头上面一个、两只眼珠各长一个，口中咬的剑柄头也雕成虎头形状。面形明显修长，纵向感强，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定，下半部口部、下颌或须部线条更突出；口鼻处理较夸张，兽面感明显，外形偏向镇邪类面具。": "Four smaller tiger heads appear within one large tiger head: one on the forehead, one in each eye and one on the pommel of the sword held in its mouth. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced, the mouth, jaw or beard is more prominent in the lower face. The exaggerated mouth and nose suggest an animal face and the appearance of a protective mask.",
