  "色彩以红褐色和橙黄色为主，局部有朱红色和深红色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩较鲜明。": "The main colors are reddish brown and yellow-orange, with accents of vermilion and dark red; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, vivid colors.",
