  "彭国龙一脸虔诚地说，箱里的唐将军傩面具是他从事傩雕以来花费心血最多、耗费时间最长的古傩面具。面形明显修长，纵向感强，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡；眉眼和口鼻通常处理得较有力度，整体面相偏威严。": "Peng Guolong says that the General Tang mask in the box required more care and time than any other traditional Nuo mask he had carved. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced. Forceful brows, eyes, mouth and nose give the face an imposing expression.",
