  "头戴三山飞凤帽，身穿一领淡鹅黄。面形明显修长，纵向感强，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡；眉眼和口鼻通常处理得较有力度，整体面相偏威严。": "Wearing a three-peaked flying-phoenix hat and a pale yellow robe. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced. Forceful brows, eyes, mouth and nose give the face an imposing expression.",
  "色彩以黑色和青色为主，局部有朱红色和橙黄色点缀；整体色调较均衡，明暗对比明显，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are black and cyan, with accents of vermilion and yellow-orange; a balanced overall palette, strong light–dark contrast, moderate saturation.",
  "账房先生，根据世俗形象塑造，发辫盘起，戴着眼镜，一副幽默精明的样子。脸形接近方正，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡。": "The accountant is modeled on an everyday figure, with a coiled braid and glasses that give him a witty, shrewd appearance. The face is approximately square, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced.",
  "色彩以橙黄色和黑色为主，局部有棕褐色和灰色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are yellow-orange and black, with accents of brown and gray; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
