  "脸形接近方正，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，五官布局较均衡，上半部装饰和额顶部分更醒目，整体属于正面展开的人物面具，外轮廓和五官关系清楚。": "The face is approximately square, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the facial features are evenly balanced, the upper decoration and forehead stand out, it is a front-facing human mask with a clear relationship between the outline and features.",
  "色彩以黑色和灰色为主，局部有棕褐色和橙黄色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗对比明显，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are black and gray, with accents of brown and yellow-orange; a warm overall palette, strong light–dark contrast, moderate saturation.",
  "色彩以灰色和黑色为主，局部有橙黄色和红色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗对比明显，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are gray and black, with accents of yellow-orange and red; a warm overall palette, strong light–dark contrast, moderate saturation.",
