  "整体轮廓偏长，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡；眉眼和口部处理较柔和，表情倾向含笑、亲近。": "The overall outline is elongated, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced. Softly treated brows, eyes and mouth create a smiling, approachable expression.",
