  "消灾和尚，又称减灾和尚，一般以挤眉弄眼、豁牙露齿的形象出现，能帮人消灾去难、逢凶化吉。整体轮廓偏长，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定；眉眼和口部处理较柔和，表情倾向含笑、亲近。": "The Calamity-Dispelling Monk, also called the Calamity-Reducing Monk, typically winks and grins with gaps in his teeth; in the tradition he helps avert misfortune. The overall outline is elongated, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced. Softly treated brows, eyes and mouth create a smiling, approachable expression.",
  "色彩以橙黄色和朱红色为主，局部有红褐色和灰色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗对比明显，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are yellow-orange and vermilion, with accents of reddish brown and gray; a warm overall palette, strong light–dark contrast, moderate saturation.",
