  "整体轮廓偏长，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定，下半部口部、下颌或须部线条更突出；眉眼和口鼻通常处理得较有力度，整体面相偏威严。": "The overall outline is elongated, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced, the mouth, jaw or beard is more prominent in the lower face. Forceful brows, eyes, mouth and nose give the face an imposing expression.",
  "色彩以灰色和深灰色为主，局部有橙黄色和黑色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are gray and dark gray, with accents of yellow-orange and black; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
  "脸形接近方正，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定，上半部装饰和额顶部分更醒目；五官线条相对细致，面相较柔和，常以头饰、眉眼或唇部表现人物身份。": "The face is approximately square, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced, the upper decoration and forehead stand out. The features are relatively delicate and gentle; the headdress, brows, eyes or lips often convey the character's identity.",
