  "郎神俊雅衣黄，力大无穷，法术无边，通晓八九玄功，阙庭有神眼，手持三尖两刃刀。面形明显修长，纵向感强，线条层次适中，五官分区明确，左右结构稳定，下半部口部、下颌或须部线条更突出；眉眼和口鼻通常处理得较有力度，整体面相偏威严。": "Erlang Shen is a handsome, yellow-robed figure with extraordinary strength and powers, a divine eye on his forehead and a three-pointed, double-edged blade. The face is distinctly elongated, with a strong vertical emphasis, the lines have moderate detail and the facial features are clearly separated, the left and right sides are structurally balanced, the mouth, jaw or beard is more prominent in the lower face. Forceful brows, eyes, mouth and nose give the face an imposing expression.",
