  "色彩以灰色和红色为主，局部有棕褐色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are gray and red, with accents of brown; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
  "四川双峰傩面具又称为脸壳子，起初是用蔑条挽成各个人物脸庞大小的蔑圈，傩戏艺人根据不同脸庞用报纸粘糊成形，再根据纸糊成形的脸壳，用画笔圈圈点点的描绘上五颜六色。面部横向展开，外轮廓较宽，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡。": "Shuangfeng Nuo masks from Sichuan are also called face shells. Originally, bamboo strips formed a frame sized to each character's face; performers pasted newspaper over it and painted the resulting shell in many colors. The face spreads horizontally, creating a broad outline, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced.",
