  "色彩以灰色和橙黄色为主，局部有棕褐色和黄色点缀；整体色调偏暖，明暗层次适中，色彩饱和度适中。": "The main colors are gray and yellow-orange, with accents of brown and yellow; a warm overall palette, moderate tonal variation, moderate saturation.",
