  "其面具一般为浓眉、大眼、虎口、勾鼻，威武勇猛，意在降妖伏魔。面部横向展开，外轮廓较宽，额面、五官和装饰线条较密，五官布局较均衡。": "The mask usually has thick brows, large eyes, a tiger-like mouth and a hooked nose, conveying martial power intended to subdue harmful spirits. The face spreads horizontally, creating a broad outline, the forehead, features and decoration are densely articulated, the facial features are evenly balanced.",
