  "先从照片中提取前景，再将相近颜色归并为 {count} 种项目聚类色。归并阈值 ΔE00 ≤ {threshold}。这些色名是本项目的索引，不是传统颜料名称。": "Foregrounds are extracted from photographs, then similar colors are merged into {count} project color clusters at a threshold of ΔE00 ≤ {threshold}. These color names are project indexes, not traditional pigment names.",
  "单图占比取自该图已有的前景像素映射记录；同一图片中重复出现的聚类色先合并。全局占比是 {total} 张图片的等权平均，地域占比是在对应地域内等权平均。出现样本数按不同图片去重。": "Per-image shares use the existing foreground pixel mappings, combining repeated clusters within each image. Global shares are equal-weight averages across {total} images; regional shares are equal-weight averages within each region. Sample counts refer to distinct images.",
  "平均有 {share} 的比例未纳入现有记录，原因待核。色条用斜线保留余量，不将已知颜色重新放大到 100%。微小占比显示为 0.0% 时仅是四舍五入。": "An average of {share} is absent from the existing records; the reason remains unverified. Hatching preserves this remainder instead of rescaling known colors to 100%. Very small shares may round to 0.0%.",
